      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## End-to-End No show appointment CRM sync + send a reschedule link to whatsapp\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow reacts to a Cal.com webhook when an appointment is marked as a no-show. It verifies the event, retrieves booking details, prevents duplicate processing through Google Sheets, updates the matching CRM contact in HighLevel, logs the no-show, and conditionally sends a WhatsApp reschedule message. Duplicate no-show records are skipped without further CRM or messaging actions.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Cal.com webhook to send no-show booking events to the n8n webhook URL.\n- Add Cal.com API credentials or headers to the booking-details HTTP request node.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and configure the duplicate-check and no-show log sheet, spreadsheet, and column mappings.\n- Connect HighLevel credentials and confirm the contact lookup and no_show status update fields match your CRM schema.\n- Connect WhatsApp credentials and configure the message template, recipient phone field, and reschedule link.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the no-show filter conditions, duplicate matching key, CRM custom fields, sheet columns, and WhatsApp reschedule message or link to match your appointment process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b3c04c86-c468-4599-8c31-f508b94b097b",
